<title>FINLAND: FINLAND BANK SEP DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 6.33 BLN.</title>
<headline>FINLAND BANK SEP DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 6.33 BLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland said on</p>
<p>Tuesday the required daily money market liquidity balance for</p>
<p>the rest of the month was 6.33 billion markka.</p>
<p>The central bank gave the following figures (FIM mln):</p>
<p> Liquidity estimate for Sept 5		     12,900</p>
<p> Minimum reserve requirement for Sep		6,406</p>
<p> Average reserves to Sept 2			   7,491</p>
<p> Required daily balance for remaining period    6,328</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom, +358-0-680 50 245</p>
</text>
